==================================================
1. CURRENT PRODUCER MONITOR BEHAVIOR TO PRESERVE
==================================================

The existing Producer Monitor currently exposes producer lifecycle information such as:

- Produced
- Pending accepted
- Filled
- Committed
- Cancel requested
- Entry failed
- Cleanup cancelled
- Cleanup cancel failed
- Latest canonical event

Preserve all of these capabilities and existing producer names/cards.

Existing producers include at least:

- NormalLegacy
- Equity
- Case3AReplacement
- Case11APeakReversal
- Case11BBottomReversal
- Case13APeakSell
- Case13BBottomBuy
