==================================================

Do not persist a FailureSummary as another source of truth.

Derive it from retained ProducerAttempts and ProducerEvents.

A derived model may look like:

type ProducerFailureSummary struct {
    FailedAfterProduced int

    ByErrorCode map[EntryProduceErrorCode]int

    LatestFailure *ProducerEvent
}

