14. FRONTEND / BACKEND OWNERSHIP
==================================================

The BOT OPS frontend does NOT own ProducerHistory.

The frontend only renders data returned by the BOT OPS backend.

The backend/state manager owns:

- updating ProducerMonitorState
- adding/updating ProducerAttempt
- recording ProducerEvent
- removing attempts older than 24h
- persisting state
- rebuilding state after restart
- deriving card statistics
- deriving FailureSummary
- providing producer performance/dormancy information

The frontend should remain a presentation layer.

