==================================================

Producer information must survive BOT OPS/bot restart within the retention period.

On startup:

- load Producer Monitor state file
- validate it
- discard attempts older than 24 hours
- rebuild any derived indexes/caches
- continue using the retained attempts

Do not depend on the dashboard having remained open.

